{"unit_id":"Xenia0922__dsh-opencode-go-usage#card-zh","repo":"Xenia0922/dsh-opencode-go-usage","commit":"c25bf52019b38bd983c5dd484e06a5a1565c246c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-opencode-go-usage**（DSH 网页插件）：在 DSH 中提供 OpenCode Go 用量与费用仪表盘。它通过悬浮按钮打开可拖动、缩放和最大化的面板，分别展示 DSH 会话事件和 OpenCode 官方数据。主要功能包括按日/月/累计查看请求与 token、按模型查看费用、浏览趋势与最近会话、查看滚动/周/月配额，以及导出 CSV；官方明细可用时会回填逐请求费用。适合希望在 DSH 内跟踪 OpenCode Go 使用情况的用户。官方账户数据需要 OpenCode 登录凭据和 workspace ID；本地会话统计使用 DSH 会话数据。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host.js:148","src/host.js:1184","src/client.js:417","src/client.js:587"]}
{"unit_id":"Xenia0922__dsh-opencode-go-usage#card-en","repo":"Xenia0922/dsh-opencode-go-usage","commit":"c25bf52019b38bd983c5dd484e06a5a1565c246c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"**dsh-opencode-go-usage** is a DSH web dashboard for OpenCode Go. Its floating panel shows DSH session usage, official quota and request costs, model and daily summaries, recent sessions, and CSV export. Official account details require OpenCode credentials and a workspace ID.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host.js:148","src/host.js:1184","src/client.js:417","src/client.js:587"]}
